preConditionHook:
// Brooks's shaved top / shaved bottom: the close is within shaveOffsetPoints
// of the bar's high (long) / of its low (short), so there is no tail at the
// far end.
//
// The source states the tolerance in TICKS. `minmove` and `pricescale` are
// UNKNOWN in EL_FEATURES and ctx exposes no tick size at all, so the tolerance
// is carried as a PRICE-POINT input, per AUTHORING.md and the convention the
// rest of this batch follows (CloseNearPriorLow, LimitEntryAtMicroGapEdge).
// The default 0.25 is the book's one tick at the Emini's tick size and is
// therefore instrument-specific -- a grid-pass concern.
//
// Not CloseRangePosition, which puts the close in the upper FRACTION of the
// bar's own range: an absolute offset is far stricter on a wide bar and far
// looser on a one-tick bar, so the two fire on different bars.
